1
00:00:00,736 --> 00:00:04,422
The order arrived two days late
and paralyzed my team.

2
00:00:05,505 --> 00:00:07,898
I want a 30% discount on the invoice.

3
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:13,679
This is Lola, she's furious and she's an AI.

4
00:00:14,836 --> 00:00:18,082
Sparring lets salespeople and
support agents rehearse

5
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:21,312
their toughest conversations out loud

6
00:00:21,884 --> 00:00:23,698
before they happen for real.

7
00:00:25,952 --> 00:00:29,610
It gives us the option to practice
with a difficult customer

8
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:32,016
before handling a real one.

9
00:00:32,946 --> 00:00:34,291
It helps you arrive better prepared.

10
00:00:35,053 --> 00:00:36,301
Let's see an example.

11
00:00:39,326 --> 00:00:42,423
We agree to send the audio to AssemblyAI

12
00:00:42,552 --> 00:00:44,681
for this practice, and for Sparring to use

13
00:00:44,681 --> 00:00:47,763
the transcript to assess the practice.
Let's begin.

14
00:00:51,076 --> 00:00:53,810
The order arrived two days late
and paralyzed my team.

15
00:00:54,331 --> 00:00:56,576
I want a 30% discount on the invoice.

16
00:00:58,232 --> 00:01:00,717
I understand the impact of a 2-day delay

17
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:04,074
on your team's operations.
I deeply regret the delay.

18
00:01:04,687 --> 00:01:08,117
Before I propose a next step,
what's most urgent for you today?

19
00:01:11,169 --> 00:01:13,547
What's most urgent is recovering
the money for the productivity

20
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:15,807
loss this caused us.

21
00:01:16,244 --> 00:01:19,603
An apology means nothing to me
if you don't cover the financial damage.

22
00:01:21,324 --> 00:01:22,402
I understand your position.

23
00:01:22,836 --> 00:01:25,538
Refunding shipping won't get back
the hours you lost.

24
00:01:25,731 --> 00:01:29,801
What I can offer right now
is a refund of the $25 shipping fee.

25
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:32,717
I can also escalate the
compensation request

26
00:01:32,782 --> 00:01:35,552
so you get a response
within 4 business hours.

27
00:01:36,084 --> 00:01:37,936
It wouldn't be honest to promise you 30%.

28
00:01:38,113 --> 00:01:40,568
Which of the steps I mentioned
would help you most?

29
00:01:44,045 --> 00:01:46,645
A shipping refund is a joke,

30
00:01:47,256 --> 00:01:49,871
my workers lost hours
of work because of you.

31
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:53,080
You are at fault and you have
to cover the losses.

32
00:01:53,208 --> 00:01:57,443
I demand to speak with someone who
can decide, if you can't authorize the 30%.

33
00:01:57,860 --> 00:02:02,063
I understand you're worried about
waiting again with no news.

34
00:02:02,272 --> 00:02:06,587
I'll escalate your request
and follow up

35
00:02:06,587 --> 00:02:09,363
using the simulated reference SUP 9482.

36
00:02:09,716 --> 00:02:11,528
The response will arrive
within 4 business hours.

37
00:02:11,657 --> 00:02:14,635
Do you agree with that next step?
Any other questions?

38
00:02:18,402 --> 00:02:22,639
How do I know you won't leave me
waiting another three days with no response?

39
00:02:22,995 --> 00:02:25,389
I need assurance that this
will be resolved today.

40
00:02:26,964 --> 00:02:31,934
The process, unfortunately, is
to escalate the request.

41
00:02:32,128 --> 00:02:38,008
With the request number we have,
you can expect

42
00:02:38,365 --> 00:02:42,952
your response to be handled
by someone who does have authorization.

43
00:02:45,250 --> 00:02:47,589
Fine, I accept that you escalate it,

44
00:02:47,784 --> 00:02:49,977
but you'd better really contact me
within that

45
00:02:50,139 --> 00:02:52,787
4-hour window — I won't waste
more time on this.

46
00:02:54,856 --> 00:02:57,218
Yes, it's the company's normal process.

47
00:02:57,989 --> 00:02:59,756
If you have no other questions—

48
00:03:04,818 --> 00:03:08,248
No more questions for now,
but I'll be waiting for your follow-up.

49
00:03:09,288 --> 00:03:10,514
Goodbye.

50
00:03:14,034 --> 00:03:18,050
You scored 75 with
100% coverage.

51
00:03:18,416 --> 00:03:20,133
Your strength was handling...

52
00:03:23,843 --> 00:03:26,544
And that's how Sparring works.

53
00:03:27,725 --> 00:03:31,558
I hope you enjoyed the process.

